Tom: How about holding a charity sale? We could sell things we make ourselves.
Lucy: That''s a great idea. What could we sell?
Tom: I enjoy baking, so I could make some cakes and cookies.
Lucy: Perfect. I''m good at painting, so I''ll sell some handmade cards.
Tom: Who should we give the money to?
Lucy: Let''s donate it to the children''s hospital in our city.
Tom: Wonderful. I''m really looking forward to organising it together.', 'Green 老师让 Lucy 和 Tom 为学校策划慈善活动;Tom 提议办义卖,卖自己做的东西;Tom 会烤蛋糕饼干,Lucy 擅长画画会卖手工卡片;他们决定把钱捐给本市儿童医院;Tom 很期待一起筹办。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What event are the two students planning?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["A charity sale.","A sports day.","A school trip.","A music concert."]},{"q":"What will Tom make for the sale?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Handmade cards.","Cakes and cookies.","Posters.","Toys."]},{"q":"What is Lucy good at?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Painting.","Singing.","Cooking.","Dancing."]},{"q":"Who will receive the money they raise?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Their head teacher.","The children''s hospital.","A local shop.","Themselves."]},{"q":"How does Tom feel about the plan?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["He thinks it will fail.","He is too busy for it.","He is looking forward to it.","He dislikes the idea."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective2', 'U3', 'sufe');
Volunteers sort the food carefully and pack it into boxes.
Families who do not have enough to eat can come and receive a box for free.
Most of the food is donated by shops, schools and ordinary people.
Thanks to food banks, fewer people in the city go hungry.', '食物银行收集食物并分发给有需要的人;志愿者仔细分类并装箱;吃不饱的家庭可以免费领取一箱;食物大多由商店、学校和普通人捐赠;有了食物银行,城里挨饿的人减少了。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What does a food bank do?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["It sells food at low prices.","It cooks meals in restaurants.","It grows vegetables on a farm.","It collects food and gives it to people in need."]},{"q":"What do the volunteers do with the food?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["They sort it and pack it into boxes.","They throw most of it away.","They eat it themselves.","They sell it to shops."]},{"q":"How much do needy families pay for a box?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["A small fee.","Nothing; it is free.","The full price.","Double the price."]},{"q":"Where does most of the food come from?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["The government only.","Foreign countries.","Donations from shops, schools and people.","Faraway farms."]},{"q":"What is the result of having food banks?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["More people become rich.","Food prices go up.","Shops have to close.","Fewer people go hungry."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'elective2', 'U3', 'sufe');
Jack: Really? What did you do there?
Mia: I fed the dogs and helped clean their cages.
Jack: That sounds like hard work. Did you enjoy it?
Mia: Yes, I loved it. The animals are so grateful for a little care.
Jack: Maybe I could join you next time. I''m interested in helping too.
Mia: That would be great. They always need more volunteers.
Jack: Then count me in. I can''t wait to meet the dogs.', 'Mia 整个周末在动物收容所做志愿者;喂狗、帮忙清理笼子;虽然辛苦但她很喜欢,动物对一点点照顾都心怀感激;Jack 也有兴趣帮忙,想下次加入;Mia 说收容所总缺志愿者;Jack 决定参加,迫不及待想见小狗。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Where did Mia volunteer at the weekend?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["At an animal shelter.","At a hospital.","At a library.","At a school."]},{"q":"What did Mia do there?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["She painted the walls.","She fed the dogs and cleaned their cages.","She cooked the meals.","She sold tickets."]},{"q":"How did Mia feel about the work?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["She found it boring.","She regretted going.","She loved it despite the hard work.","She was angry about it."]},{"q":"What does Jack want to do?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Stay at home instead.","Adopt all the dogs.","Open his own shelter.","Join Mia and help next time."]},{"q":"What does the shelter always need?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["More volunteers.","Less food.","Fewer animals.","Only money."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective2', 'U3', 'sufe');
People poured a bucket of ice and water over their heads.
Then they asked their friends to do the same or to give money.
The aim was to raise awareness of a serious disease and to collect donations.
In the end, the challenge raised millions of dollars for research.', '几年前,一项叫''冰桶挑战''的有趣活动传遍世界;人们把一桶冰水浇在头上;然后请朋友照做或捐钱;目的是提高对一种严重疾病的关注并募集善款;最终为研究筹得数百万美元。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What did people do in the Ice Bucket Challenge?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["They ran a long race.","They poured ice water over their heads.","They climbed a mountain.","They sang in public."]},{"q":"What did they ask their friends to do?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Pay for their dinner.","Keep it a secret.","Do the same or donate money.","Stop the activity."]},{"q":"What was the aim of the challenge?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["To win a big prize.","To have a private party.","To sell ice.","To raise awareness and collect donations."]},{"q":"How much did the challenge raise in the end?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Millions of dollars.","Only a few coins.","Nothing at all.","Only food."]},{"q":"What was the money used for?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Building a new school.","Research into a serious disease.","Buying more ice.","A long holiday."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'elective2', 'U3', 'sufe');
Sam: No, what is it about?
Ella: We collect books we don''t need and give them to a village school.
Sam: What a kind idea! I have lots of old storybooks at home.
Ella: Perfect. Could you bring them to the school library on Monday?
Sam: Of course. Is there anything else I can do to help?
Ella: We also need volunteers to pack the books. Would you mind helping?
Sam: Not at all. I''d be happy to spend Saturday packing books.', 'Ella 提到下周的旧书募集活动;收集不需要的书捐给乡村学校;Sam 家里有很多旧故事书,愿意周一带到学校图书馆;他还想多帮忙;Ella 说需要志愿者装箱;Sam 乐意周六去帮忙装书。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What is the book drive for?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Selling new books for profit.","Building a new library.","Giving used books to a village school.","Buying toys."]},{"q":"What does Sam have at home?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Many new toys.","Old clothes.","Spare money.","Lots of old storybooks."]},{"q":"When should Sam bring the books?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["On Monday.","On Sunday.","Next month.","Right now."]},{"q":"What extra help does Ella need?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Drivers only.","Volunteers to pack the books.","More money.","A bigger room."]},{"q":"How does Sam respond to helping on Saturday?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["He firmly refuses.","He says he is too busy.","He is happy to help.","He asks to be paid."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective2', 'U3', 'sufe');
The next time someone helps you, do not just say thank you.
Instead, try to pass that kindness on to another person.
You could help a classmate, comfort a friend or give up your seat.
These small acts cost nothing, but together they can change a whole community.', '让世界更友善的简单方法:下次有人帮你时,别只说谢谢;试着把这份善意传递给别人;可以帮助同学、安慰朋友或让座;这些小事毫不费钱,但合在一起就能改变整个社区。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What is this passage mainly about?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Saving money carefully.","Winning prizes.","Making friends abroad.","Passing kindness on to others."]},{"q":"What does the speaker suggest doing when someone helps you?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Pass the kindness on to another person.","Pay them back at once.","Forget about it quickly.","Keep it a secret."]},{"q":"Which is given as an example of a small act of kindness?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Buying a car.","Giving up your seat.","Travelling abroad.","Winning a race."]},{"q":"How much do these small acts cost?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["A lot of money.","A whole day.","Nothing.","A large gift."]},{"q":"What can these small acts do together?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Make everyone rich.","Build new houses.","Stop the rain.","Change a whole community."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'elective2', 'U3', 'sufe');

